    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "35510baca69a571dfc07": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "6e64fa810aabf31c28a4": "I seek more training in the priestly ways.",
        "7259c18c21441e634202": "You be watchin' yerself, $c. Respect our ways, or a curse be on you and yours.",
        "a82fe89b3dbae2753e26": "I do what me can to train you in the priestly ways, if that what you be here for."
      },
      "name": "Zayus",
      "subName": "High Priest",
      "translationMetadata": {
